OL,4,BATP increases player compensation to   
OL,5,B$350m                                  
OL,6,GThe men's ATP Tour is promising its    
OL,7,Gplayers rewards of at least $350m in   
OL,8,G2028 - but the board has delayed a     
OL,9,Gdecision on hotly disputed changes to  
OL,10,Gdoubles until next month.              
OL,12,FThe bonus pool will increase from the  
OL,13,Fcurrent $21.5m to $50m in 2028, with   
OL,14,Fpayments offered to players ranked in  
OL,15,Fthe world's top 30 at the start of     
OL,16,Feach Masters 1000 event.               
OL,18,FThe world number one will receive the  
OL,19,Fhighest bonus of $2m for each of the   
OL,20,FMasters events they play.              
